    {
      "source": "Custom <a href=\"../Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> to carry the average distance retrieved from the <a href=\"../../geo/GeoResults.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>GeoResults</code></a> the <a href=\"../../geo/GeoPage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>GeoPage</code></a> is set up\nfrom.",
